# GüvenPoliçe API — REST Client (VS Code) / JetBrains HTTP Client
# Refresh token httpOnly cookie'dir; istemcinin cookie jar'ı otomatik taşır.
@api = http://localhost:8080
@password = Demo-Parola-2026

### Sağlık
GET {{api}}/health

### Metrikler
GET {{api}}/metrics

### Giriş (acente)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "acente@guvenpolice.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Müşteriler (AGENT/UNDERWRITER)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/customers?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Refresh (cookie ile)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Çıkış
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Yanlış parola → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "acente@guvenpolice.test", "password": "yanlis"}

### Geçerli tarife (başlangıç tarihine göre)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tariffs/active?product=KASKO&date=2026-11-01
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Teklif önizleme (kaydetmez) — customer_id: demo Ayşe Demir
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": 1, "product": "KASKO", "term_start": "2026-11-01", "ncd_level": 2, "vehicle_group": "C", "plate": "34ABC123", "coverages": ["KASKO_ANA", "CAM"]}

### Teklif kaydet
# @name quote
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id": 1, "product": "KASKO", "term_start": "2026-11-01", "ncd_level": 2, "vehicle_group": "C", "plate": "34ABC123", "coverages": ["KASKO_ANA", "CAM"]}

### Teklif listesi / detayı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/quotes?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quote.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Poliçeye çevir (aynı anahtarla tekrar → aynı yanıt, Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/{{quote.response.body.id}}/convert
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-convert-1

### Poliçe listesi
GET {{api}}/api/v1/policies?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Underwriter girişi
# @name uw
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "underwriter@guvenpolice.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Onay bekleyen teklifler
GET {{api}}/api/v1/quotes?status=UW_REVIEW
Authorization: Bearer {{uw.response.body.access_token}}

### Underwriter kararı (id'yi listeden alın)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/quotes/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{uw.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "APPROVE", "note": "uygun"}
